CHAPTER.VERS:
Go

          {+}
        , inquire of Yahweh for me, and for those who are left in Israel and in Judah, concerning the words of the book that was found; for great is the wrath of Yahweh that is poured out on us, because our fathers have not kept the word of Yahweh, to do according to all that is written in this book.

And she said to them, This is what Yahweh, the God of Israel, says: Tell

          {+}
         the man who sent you

          {+}
         to me,

But to the king of Judah, who sent you

          {+}
         to inquire of Yahweh, thus you

          {+}
         will say to him, This is what Yahweh, the God of Israel, says: As concerning the words which you have heard,
